Scoped edgedetect video filter

The option table (edgedetect_options: high, low, mode with the wires/colormix/
canny constants, planes with the y/u/v/r/g/b flags unit), init's low_u8/high_u8
rounding, the per-mode query_formats lists, config_props plane geometry, and
filter_frame with color_mix in src/video-ops/edgedetect.ts and
src/video-edgedetect.ts follow libavfilter/vf_edgedetect.c. The kernels
gaussian_blur and sobel (DEPTH 8) follow libavfilter/edge_template.c, and
get_rounded_direction, ff_non_maximum_suppression and ff_double_threshold follow
libavfilter/edge_common.c. The AV_OPT_TYPE_FLAGS +/- term folding follows
libavutil/opt.c set_string_number and write_number.
